      "title": "Lethal trifecta: untrusted input + private data + external sink",
      "detail": "Server \"mcp\" exposes tools that together enable an exfiltration flow. Untrusted content: list_map_comments · Private data: commit_version · Public sink: set_performance, set_turnout, share_simulation, roll_up_primary, primary_batch_edit, set_race_scope · Destructive: set_candidates, call_tool.",
